WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
普通公共服务先行：没有 AI，城市仍可用。 / Ordinary public service comes first: the city works without AI.

00:10.000 --> 00:20.000
AI 只在契约允许的窗口内提供辅助，不接管权利。 / AI assists only inside a contract-defined window; it does not take over rights.

00:20.000 --> 00:30.000
人工窗口、停止权和非智能路径始终可见。 / A human window, stop authority and a non-digital path remain visible.

00:30.000 --> 00:40.000
退场后留下公共空间、维护线路和可审计记录。 / After exit, public space, maintenance routes and auditable records remain.
